21. What Is the Difference Between Certificate Renewal and Certificate Deployment?
This is a subtle but valuable point.

You can say:

“Renewing a certificate and deploying the certificate are two separate activities. Having the renewed certificate available in the certificate store doesn't mean the load balancer is actually serving it.”

Think:

Certificate Issued
       ↓
Certificate Available
       ↓
Certificate Attached
       ↓
Listener Uses Certificate
       ↓
Endpoint Serves Certificate

The incident occurred because the process stopped somewhere between certificate renewal and certificate deployment/attachment.

